| Feature | Standard JPEG Pipeline | DeepN-JPEG Pipeline |
|---|---|---|
| **Optimization Goal** | Visual Quality (PSNR/SSIM) | Inference Accuracy |
| **Target Audience** | Human Eyes | Deep Neural Networks |
| **Quantization** | General purpose (Fixed) | Task-specific (Customized) |
| **Efficiency** | Moderate for AI tasks | High (3.5x better for AI) |
| **Compatibility** | Standard | Standard (Backward compatible) |
